  "bio": "Hailing from the charming locale of Marguerittes, France, Sora Infinite is a masterful tattoo artist whose expertise shines in sketch and fineline styles. At Quadrilatéra Tattoo Shop, Sora maintains a stellar reputation for their professionalism, ensuring each client receives a high-quality experience from consultation to the finished ink. With a keen eye for blackwork, abstract designs, and illustration, this artist's needle weaves artistry with the utmost precision and dedication.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Marguerittes, Occitanie, France",
